e": "Screenshot_2880x1600_f88cf.png", "id": "1867940793774393", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617813_1867940797107726_5466069117076797571_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HPSyCvnpcZIQ7kNvwGcTVW7&_nc_oc=Ado11kGA9uidzuqOz4PAVAUo1T66PyydqsEr3mxatV-hCBbpjoSp0RxWtpgJN52HW6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSOTkMbFihLjkINL1wPj4hFr2fECPebAIEB4LCGajJ4Vw&oe=6AFB45CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Muvia Skiing", "keywords": ["games", "skiing", "rehab", "rehabilitation"], "long_description": "Muvia Skiing transforms rehabilitation into an immersive adventure - blending VR, AI, and real-world motion to restore movement and rebuild lives.\n\nMore than just a game, Muvia Skiing offers a unique fusion of gamified therapy and exhilarating sports experiences. Set in beautifully crafted winter landscapes, players ski through challenging slopes, practice balance, and engage in dynamic, full-body movements that stimulate both body and mind.\n\nDesigned for both home and clinical use, each session delivers real-time feedback and motion monitoring - supporting personalized progress for recreational users and those on a rehabilitation journey alike.\n\nWhether you're training, recovering, or just having fun, Muvia Skiing brings the thrill of the slopes - and real therapeutic results - right to you.", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of skiing while enhancing your movement and balance. Muvia Skiing combines immersive VR gameplay with therapeutic benefits and real-time feedback, bringing the excitement of winter adventures to everyone, anywhere."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.muvia.ai/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.muvia.ai/terms", "publisher_name": "Muvia Inc. ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.muvia.ai/", "category": null, "comfort_r